# Scenograph C2 headed check, run 2 of 2: a distinct process over run 1's
# TURNSTONE_ROOT. The choices come back from the view sidecar by id, and the
# kept command answers a search with its catalogue label.
settle 60
key escape
assert snap commands-added == Reseed layout
assert snap commands-removed == view:fit
omnibar actions
settle 10
assert snap suggestions ~ Back
type reseed
settle 10
assert snap suggestions ~ Reseed layout
capture 01_restored_choices
key escape
log command menu restart receipt complete
